{
  "id": "noise_generated_by_road_traffic",
  "title": "Noise generated by Road Traffic",
  "description": "Estimate noise level generated by traffic. This tool calculates hourly traffic noise levels based on vehicle count, speed, and percentage of heavy vehicles.",
  "type": "datatable",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Noise Level Estimation\n\nEstimate the hourly noise level generated by road traffic based on:\n- Number of vehicles per hour\n- Road speed (reference: 75 km/h)\n- Percentage of heavy vehicles\n\n### How to use:\n1. Enter the number of vehicles per hour\n2. Enter the percentage of heavy vehicles (0-100%)\n3. Use the reference charts to determine base noise level for 75 km/h speed\n4. Add the heavy vehicle correction factor\n\n### Example:\n- 100 vehicles/hour at 75 km/h = 62 dBA\n- 15% heavy vehicles correction = +3 dBA\n- **Total = 65 dBA**"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "vehicles_per_hour",
          "label": "Vehicles per hour",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 100,
          "unit": "vehicles/h"
        },
        {
          "id": "heavy_vehicle_percentage",
          "label": "Percentage of heavy vehicles",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 15,
          "unit": "%"
        },
        {
          "id": "base_noise_level",
          "label": "Base noise level (from chart at 75 km/h)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 62,
          "unit": "dBA"
        },
        {
          "id": "heavy_vehicle_correction",
          "label": "Heavy vehicle correction factor (from chart)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 3,
          "unit": "dBA"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "total_noise_level",
          "label": "Estimated hourly noise level",
          "formula": "inputs.base_noise_level + inputs.heavy_vehicle_correction",
          "unit": "dBA",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Parameter",
        "Value",
        "Unit"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Vehicles per hour",
          "inputs.vehicles_per_hour",
          "vehicles/h"
        ],
        [
          "Heavy vehicles percentage",
          "inputs.heavy_vehicle_percentage",
          "%"
        ],
        [
          "Base noise level (75 km/h)",
          "inputs.base_noise_level",
          "dBA"
        ],
        [
          "Heavy vehicle correction",
          "inputs.heavy_vehicle_correction",
          "dBA"
        ],
        [
          "Total estimated noise level",
          "inputs.base_noise_level + inputs.heavy_vehicle_correction",
          "dBA"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}